    "summary": "Evaluate $2+\\sqrt2+\\dfrac1{2+\\sqrt2}+\\dfrac1{\\sqrt2-2}$.",
    "summaryZh": "求 $2+\\sqrt2+\\dfrac1{2+\\sqrt2}+\\dfrac1{\\sqrt2-2}$ 的值。",
    "answer": "A. $2$.",
    "answerZh": "A。$2$。",
    "methods": [
      {
        "title": "Combine the reciprocal terms",
        "titleZh": "合并两个倒数",
        "steps": [
          "Write $r=\\sqrt{2}$. The two fractions have sum $[(r-2)+(r+2)]/[(r+2)(r-2)]=2r/(r^2-4)=-r$. Adding $2+r$ leaves $2$."
        ],
        "stepsZh": [
          "设 $r=\\sqrt{2}$。两分式通分后得到 $[(r-2)+(r+2)]/[(r+2)(r-2)]=2r/(r^2-4)=-r$。再加上 $2+r$，结果为 $2$。"
        ],
